      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Black Jack is a card game in which the goal is to get 21, or as",
      "translation" : "21点是一种纸牌游戏，目标是让点数达到21点，或尽可能接近21点，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "close to 21 points as possible, without going over 21.",
      "translation" : "但不能超过21点。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Before the game starts, the player must make a bet.  Once the bet",
      "translation" : "游戏开始前，玩家必须下注。下注后，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "has been made, both the dealer and the player are dealt 2 cards",
      "translation" : "荷官和玩家各发两张牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "each.  Depending on what cards you have, you can choose to ^5533FF'stay'^000000,",
      "translation" : "根据您手中的牌，可以选择^5533FF“停牌”^000000，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "or you can choose to ^5533FF'pull'^000000.",
      "translation" : "也可以选择^5533FF“要牌”^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When you choose to 'stay', you are telling the dealer that you don't",
      "translation" : "选择“停牌”时，表示您不需要更多牌了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "need anymore cards.  This allows the dealer to pull if he/she",
      "translation" : "这样荷官就可以选择是否要牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "wants to.  In order to stay, you must have ^FF3355at least 13 points^000000. The",
      "translation" : "要停牌，您的点数必须^FF3355至少为13点^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "dealer can only stay when he/she has^FF3355 17 points or more^000000.",
      "translation" : "荷官只有在点数^FF3355达到17点或以上^000000时才能停牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When you choose to 'pull', you are telling the dealer that you want",
      "translation" : "选择“要牌”时，表示您想再拿一张牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "another card.  By pulling more cards you can increase your point",
      "translation" : "多要几张牌可以增加总点数。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "total.  As long has you have ^FF3355less than 21^000000 points you can pull a",
      "translation" : "只要您的点数^FF3355低于21点^000000，您就可以从牌堆中"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "card from the deck.",
      "translation" : "要一张牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There are 3 ways to win and loose at Black Jack.",
      "translation" : "21点有3种胜负判定方式。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "1.) At the end of a Black Jack round, if you have more points",
      "translation" : "1.) 一局结束时，如果您的点数比荷官高，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "than the dealer you will win the round.  Conversely if you have",
      "translation" : "您就赢了。反之，如果您的点数比荷官低，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "less points than the dealer you will loose.",
      "translation" : "您就输了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "2.) If you pull a card that makes your point total go over 21 you",
      "translation" : "2.) 如果您要牌后总点数超过21点，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "will automatically loose the round.  This is called a ^5533FF'bust'^000000.  If",
      "translation" : "您会自动输掉这一局。这被称为^5533FF“爆牌”^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "the dealer busts then you will win the round.",
      "translation" : "如果荷官爆牌，您就赢了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "3.) If you have a point total of 21 with the first 2 cards, you",
      "translation" : "3.) 如果最初两张牌的总点数为21点，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "will automatically win the round.  This is called a ^5533FF'Black Jack'^000000",
      "translation" : "您就会自动获胜。这叫作^5533FF“21点”^000000，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "and happens when you get an 'Ace' and a '10 valued' card. If the",
      "translation" : "也就是一张A和一张点数为10的牌。如果"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "dealer gets a Black Jack he/she will automatically win the round.",
      "translation" : "荷官拿到21点，荷官就会自动获胜。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "4.) Besides winning and loosing, you can tie with the dealer.  If",
      "translation" : "4.) 除了输赢，也可能与荷官打成平局。如果"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "both you and the dealer have the same point total at the end of a",
      "translation" : "一局结束时双方点数相同，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "round, this will result in a tie with no winner and no loss or gain",
      "translation" : "就会平局，谁也不赢也不输，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "in money.",
      "translation" : "赌注金额不会增加或减少。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This is called a ^5533FF'push'^000000 with the dealer.  This also",
      "translation" : "这称为与荷官^5533FF“和局”^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "applies to both you and the dealer having Black Jack at the same",
      "translation" : "如果双方同时拿到21点，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "time.",
      "translation" : "也同样算作和局。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The 'Double Down' option allows you to double your current bet,",
      "translation" : "“加倍下注”可以将当前赌注翻倍，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "but with the drawback that you will only be able to pull one",
      "translation" : "但之后只能再要一张牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "additional card.  This option is only available at the beginning of",
