    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "give you either 15 or 5 points.",
      "translation" : "总点数就可以是15点或5点。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you decided to stay, the Ace would automatically be counted as",
      "translation" : "如果您选择停牌，A会自动算作"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "11 points to give you 15 points total.",
      "translation" : "11点，使总点数达到15点。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you had decided to pull and received a 9, the ace would",
      "translation" : "如果您选择要牌并抽到一张9，A会"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "automatically be counted as 1 point to give you a total of 14",
      "translation" : "自动算作1点，使总点数达到14点。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "points.  If the Ace was counted as 11 points, you would have a",
      "translation" : "如果A算作11点，您的总点数就会"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "point total over 21 and would have lost.",
      "translation" : "超过21点并输掉这一局。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It is because of the flexibility you have with the 'Ace' that makes",
      "translation" : "正因为A的点数可以灵活变化，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "it the most powerful card in the game.",
      "translation" : "它才是游戏中最强的牌。"
    },
    {
